# 34. Bottlenecks and Failure Points

## Common Bottlenecks

- One overloaded application server
- One overloaded database
- One overloaded load balancer
- CPU saturation
- Memory pressure
- Slow disk operations
- Insufficient network bandwidth
- Local session storage
- Local file storage
- Uneven request cost
- Slow external dependencies
- Exhausted connection pools
- Retry storms
- Service-registry overload
- Poor autoscaling metrics

## Common Failure Points

- Application server crash
