- Health-check misconfiguration
- Stale discovery data
- Registry outage
- Bad deployment routed to all users
- Cache inconsistency
- IP-hash imbalance
- Database failure
- Circuit-breaker threshold too sensitive
- Circuit-breaker threshold too relaxed
- Missing fallback
- Network partition

