- A stronger machine is affordable

## Long-Term Solution

Use horizontal scaling for:

- Traffic spikes
- Better availability
- Fault tolerance
- Autoscaling
- Reduced dependence on one server

## Required Changes

- Make application servers stateless
- Move sessions to Redis
- Move uploads to object storage
- Place a load balancer in front
