- Coordinate scheduled jobs
- Monitor external dependencies
- Add autoscaling

## Circuit Breaker Placement

Consider circuit breakers around:

- Payment service
- Inventory service
- Shipping provider
- Recommendation service
- Notification provider

## Recommended Approach

```text
Immediate:
    Scale the existing server vertically

Long Term:
    Scale stateless application servers horizontally
